 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_a9ddccdb609ec76485ef",
   "sourceHash": "a9ddccdb609ec76485ef6416e5d0547dbc32b0bb2d24367433873b58c5885e54",
   "text": "HORARIO DE YOGA",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f80591aa09df97dc7217",
   "sourceHash": "f80591aa09df97dc7217a30f95a4577fc3c8cf659b24d4650fe012f917c0fe43",
   "text": "El programa está abierto tanto a principiantes como a alumnos avanzados. Practicamos todos los días. Los cursos semanales van del Sábado (encuentro de bienvenida) hasta el Viernes por la tarde.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0c546e974c00bb22f24b",
   "sourceHash": "0c546e974c00bb22f24b11302b82b18690b80fef56bb1be81f1d2057c1015113",
   "text": "07.00 am a 08:00 am – Ashtanga Yoga",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2945f173b5a78ec63809",
   "sourceHash": "2945f173b5a78ec63809473f11434e5bd12a452d5020128f7b4766bb33e4353a",
   "text": "09:30 am a 12:30 pm – Masaje y tratamiento ayurvédico (franja de 1 hora por persona)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bb82c5a95e67599cc4e6",
   "sourceHash": "bb82c5a95e67599cc4e639414de1063eca25990449bd87b72858e67b806fc6ea",
   "text": "12.30 pm a 1.30 pm – Almuerzo",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_abeddad7f3d7a1d30606",
   "sourceHash": "abeddad7f3d7a1d30606e59360396024b579b231138e7b166429a427095fdf37",
   "text": "1:30 pm a 5:30 pm – Tiempo libre / Segundo masaje ayurvédico",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6d52732864476f147258",
   "sourceHash": "6d52732864476f1472584c268fff5ec8efd9bcbed072f9e7e9e93d53fd82b490",
   "text": "6:00 pm a 7:00 pm – Meditación / Pranayama",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_37eecfb8d610a1b6d949",
   "sourceHash": "37eecfb8d610a1b6d94987b893c83e13e463653e3a678fed73dbb9c4987b014f",
   "text": "7:00 pm a 8.00 pm – Cena",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e00bfb616b2c8c921a68",
   "sourceHash": "e00bfb616b2c8c921a685817ce9d4b2bf432535c235eafa868b91d8bdb40106c",
   "text": "*los horarios pueden cambiar a su llegada*",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_115a1fbd6ccf5ea714de",
   "sourceHash": "115a1fbd6ccf5ea714dea3b70610991c1ab379768936b041fa21c72a517074c3",
   "text": "Uso completo de las instalaciones del centro, incluidas la piscina, el gimnasio, la biblioteca y la sala de meditación.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'retreat facilities' rendered as 'instalaciones del centro' for the clinical register."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5f46357a609ae01c6310",
   "sourceHash": "5f46357a609ae01c63101ce1745a75f45b7bd19a62d8507772ad88875c4cdd28",
   "text": "Imagen en tres paneles de práctica de yoga y masaje en la cabeza",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4ca77afe3fd9b4b3080f",
   "sourceHash": "4ca77afe3fd9b4b3080f70f54c921369de80bae8a8467ed0ff384db6e8a62feb",
   "text": "Clases de la mañana",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4ff60280b95df8e2b869",
   "sourceHash": "4ff60280b95df8e2b869be1dcbbc00b1a30e42ca0d74324c03a4586dd0670027",
   "text": "Las sesiones matinales de Ashtanga Yoga se guiarán con suavidad. Nos centraremos en la respiración y fluiremos con ella. El movimiento y la respiración se asemejan a una danza, a un camino creativo que nos conduce a la esencia de nuestra existencia, donde descubrimos la calma, la liberación y la quietud en nuestro interior y entre todo lo creado que nos rodea.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'journey' rendered as 'camino' per the banned-word lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0163d99d8569d07e829b",
   "sourceHash": "0163d99d8569d07e829bee2fee86e2a64087822e0d4e3c73e8a42839580affe2",
   "text": "Clases de la tarde",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_92f188c8382d0fbb481b",
   "sourceHash": "92f188c8382d0fbb481be592c188f21df72927d628da95a6fc3bab66bf517f10",
   "text": "La sesión de la tarde se divide en dos áreas temáticas.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b9dc89585795108dc9a0",
   "sourceHash": "b9dc89585795108dc9a0183bb159eef6546b4b2cd4d85780977949abb28c4901",
   "text": "Primera área:",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dccf43be743c61b01548",
   "sourceHash": "dccf43be743c61b0154817caa1488317014078c21f04f9b22bd3cb5a2420ab16",
   "text": "Pondremos el acento en la meditación, es decir, en permanecer quietos en silencio. Practicar el silencio refuerza su capacidad de autorreflexión y le permite observar los pensamientos, sentimientos y deseos que surgen sin reaccionar a ellos de inmediato. Tres veces por semana realizaremos una meditación guiada centrada en el chakra del corazón, el chakra del plexo solar y el chakra raíz.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d116d3c35ffbd1ce9331",
   "sourceHash": "d116d3c35ffbd1ce93312b4768e720457c3fbab540a92eb478974e93d0e18922",
   "text": "Segunda área:",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_70d85e86e6153b8e0f0c",
   "sourceHash": "70d85e86e6153b8e0f0c6a3415c11d705e74490015a1fa18ecb0cf53da56936f",
   "text": "El pranayama, la práctica formal del control de la respiración, es la fuente de nuestra energía vital esencial. Nos centraremos en practicar ejercicios de pranayama, métodos de respiración y rutinas.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a20a1d550bb82c13b9de",
   "sourceHash": "a20a1d550bb82c13b9dead4f9fbbb2380eea01235c252fd9e5f58381a64a6f08",
   "text": "El paquete de 1 Tratamiento incluye:",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_99c181b2c3d69a64fad0",
   "sourceHash": "99c181b2c3d69a64fad01b3e5aa41bdb47bd4cbd086d5457d7d7e7b0613c0a34",
   "text": "Un masaje ayurvédico diario, Abhyangam",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_de44936716da33b25fd8",
   "sourceHash": "de44936716da33b25fd84b1e78e86c23fa35843e746e341c4e847f632e08daf6",
   "text": "El paquete de 2 Tratamientos incluye:",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1294de84a88de4cb91a6",
   "sourceHash": "1294de84a88de4cb91a6fa944bea5b58a6e451da2611cc2aea555d803c9dbbd7",
   "text": "Un Abhyangam y un tratamiento ayurvédico adicional según la prescripción del médico (p. ej., shirodhara, pizhichil, exfoliación herbal, etc.)",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
